+remove the binding only if the CSeq in the request is higher
+than the value stored for that binding.  Otherwise, the update
+<bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be aborted and the request fails.</li>
+          <li pn="section-10.3-7.7" derivedCounter="7.">
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-10.3-7.7.1">The registrar now processes each contact address in the Contact
+header field in turn.  For each address, it determines the
